# The performance-model gate (docs/performance-model.md section 12): the
# counter struct sums to `EstimateFlopsPerToken`, the precision assignment
# follows the fp8 rule, the roofline labels each family, and the estimator
# reproduces the section 7.2 bound for the depth-24 shape. Vendor-free and
# GPU-free, so it runs in the default T0 loop.
cc_test(
    name = "performance_model_test",
    srcs = ["performance_model_test.cc"],
